<title>GERMANY: EMU delay possible if big states miss targets -Buba.</title>
<headline>EMU delay possible if big states miss targets -Buba.</headline>
<dateline>GUETERSLOH, Germany 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank President Hans Tietmeyer said on Monday a delay to Europe's currency union could be considered if it became clear that big countries will fail to meet the Maastricht treaty convergence criteria.</p>
<p>&quot;If it is the case that the big countries fail to meet the criteria, than a delay could be considered,&quot; Tietmeyer said in a panel discussion before a banking audience here.</p>
</text>
